Point central catalog at immutable release revisions (#122)

All 9 package releases exist and each tag resolves to the listed rev.
This change updates catalog.json revs, aligns the contribution entry
with the renamed repo and plugin name, aligns the ASD entry id with the
installed plugin name asd-ste100-skill, and regenerates the three native
catalogs from the central source. Local alint check passes (38 rules).

